# Template Marketplace Skeleton (Permanent)

## Law

**Global SAAS catalog ≠ Business `document_templates`.**

| Layer | Store | Ownership |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Marketplace listing | PG `marketplace_templates` (+ JSON body) | Platform (no `businessId`) |
| Installed copy | PG `document_templates` + Mongo `template_bodies` | Target Business |

Install is always a **snapshot copy**. Later catalog edits do not mutate installed templates.

## Edition gate

| Edition | Marketplace |
| --- | --- |
| `SAAS` | Enabled (`templateMarketplace: true` on system config) |
| `SELF_HOSTED` | **Disabled** — routes return edition error; UI hidden |

Never leave public cross-customer catalog live on self-hosted builds (`08-dual-deployment.mdc`).

## Entitlement

Canonical code: `marketplace.templates` (`EntitlementCodes.MarketplaceTemplates`).

- Browse / install on SAAS: require this entitlement (catalog add-on).
- Mutate install: also `manage.templates` + writable.

## Payments (Non-goal — locked for this skeleton)

- **No** per-template checkout, Stripe/Zarinpal SKUs for templates, seller payouts, or marketplace invoices.
- Catalog module price for `marketplace.templates` is the **access gate only** (unlock browse/install), not a cart of individual templates.
- Do not add half-built template payment routes without a funded product track + ADR reverse.

## API (skeleton)

- `GET /api/marketplace/templates` — JWT + SAAS + entitlement
- `GET /api/marketplace/templates/:id` — same
- `POST /api/businesses/:businessId/marketplace/templates/:id/install` — SAAS + entitlement + writable + `manage.templates`

## Seller publish

Out of MVP skeleton — no “publish my Business template to marketplace” yet.
